esk/attachments/production/9136850549/original/U_FxA7ZElWe9Zr6uqTRsiUDn9dnMM0XFHw.png?1628763693\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9136850549\"></p><p><br dir=\"ltr\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Scroll to find the section in the Supplementary Pages Tab and click on a link to start filling out the information</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9136850671/original/t0t7KaNdlNZh8KeY12FPTVj3wDVNEM3lpQ.png?1628763853\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9136850671\"></p><p><br></p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on the dropdown box on the right hand side</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Select the partnership return</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click link SA800 return</li></ol><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9136850788/original/MaE0b-Ki-2e3lhE62EDIdAy9RylPKX2Hzw.png?1628763952\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9136850788\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The information will fill out automatically</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please then click save</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Having Issues?-Let's troubleshoot common issues</strong></p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Does the partner in the sa800 (under SA800 &gt; settings&gt; Partners) have the same UTR as the Individual?</strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">In the SA800 form are all of the Partners' shares and income allocated?</strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">In the SA100 have you selected the correct partnership form &nbsp;from the drop down before clicking link SA800?</strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">If you have added any supplementary pages in SA800 you should select Partnership, if you have added no supplementary pages you should choose partnership short</strong></li></ol>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205340\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205340/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205340\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000205340/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000205340\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
